#: scenario3:scenario3_C9E97BEC_821B_49B4_AD75_726CCF04AEA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b31607003715f46e7e29e281be2a61d3dcbd10eedbcf7cd9693e15b33cd3102f
#. default-sha256: 53fe8d1b3dde49a6e9c0d1e301a63c5fcd2a769e83a0e05c761aa9788801cc2e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C9E97BEC_821B_49B4_AD75_726CCF04AEA2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Ah, they have grown to be so "
"beautiful..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Ah, sono diventate così belle..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5D915F34_3442_4BDA_9B75_EA6963124549
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3be126603d0862dd23cd3e563c931f3a4996e99dade908802f71ba514ed33527
#. default-sha256: 50ae17f76821a76d02c75a36297fa6613f26bfe7ea19d873fb397ab1cbf08ea2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5D915F34_3442_4BDA_9B75_EA6963124549"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Such a wonderful fragrance.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The scent of roses is so calming.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I wonder why "
"that is..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Che profumo magnifico.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫L’aroma delle rose è così rilassante.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Chissà "
"perché..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D68FB132_36D1_43CB_8AC1_FBDE0EF33E34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 282c9e87accbe1d1e0550f6dec318a70807d324848562ed4110318629fb5ee19
#. default-sha256: 30483b2634e9b0b28f1aec148c7ba7bf45d22e8f324730482d640675d8cba6d0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D68FB132_36D1_43CB_8AC1_FBDE0EF33E34"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Would it cause any trouble if I picked one?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...Sarebbe un problema se ne raccogliessi una?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5B7634D2_4B4F_4508_8561_EF1B27F9F49C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7481fc66a3137d193a962d6d1c505844b15cd56798540500bb15cf68db7398cd
#. default-sha256: a61c767d6274dfea8131d10191f272e64f7d8c95d88d83cb7b4f28e14f5d986d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5B7634D2_4B4F_4508_8561_EF1B27F9F49C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well, hello there. Out for a midnight stroll, are you?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Quite the peculiar "
"hobby... ⟪k:4⟫“Madam”?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, salve. ⟪k:2⟫Fuori per una passeggiata notturna?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Che hobby particolare... "
"⟪k:5⟫“Madam”."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5A3AB145_58BD_41A4_8A2F_2FB5A8C21D76
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c47b3b053f14e123d9a210ea39d82b5551799ea4c0c1914c477542a078c2510
#. default-sha256: 8231b54fd180ab03fed2871624d3272f0e3de109894de8554593408b1ac32e9d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5A3AB145_58BD_41A4_8A2F_2FB5A8C21D76"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫U-⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Um, ⟪k:5⟫I cannot spend as much time as I would like outside during "
"the day, so I end up coming out at night...⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫I apologize if I startled you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ah, s-⟪k:3⟫salve. ⟪k:4⟫Ecco, io... ⟪k:5⟫durante il giorno non posso stare "
"all’aperto quanto vorrei, per cui esco solo di notte...⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Perdonami se ti ho spaventata."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F04C7A2F_4D50_486F_B1A4_9A351110B7F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f3b52994ec941f980d47da18b635ce41654d55c859a3a9410f29a16d931313b3
#. default-sha256: c3fdf4b921ad9473802006c8002f59c81f473db9b0e0408b1311403e65d2f90b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F04C7A2F_4D50_486F_B1A4_9A351110B7F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh no, not at all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh no, niente affatto."

#: scenario3:scenario3_89149FFE_056C_40EC_AA10_89D8B6933C25
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe9f60b04c05e03e36cb08dfa9a1e9420e97d91d1d953de50b0415d843197013
#. default-sha256: afb2c20418938d491dddfdf15294d30655df443084cad409312db8b8f5708e29
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_89149FFE_056C_40EC_AA10_89D8B6933C25"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫There is a chilling, captivating beauty to the sight of your snow-white form standing "
"there in the moonlit garden."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫C’è una bellezza affascinante ed agghiacciante alla vista della sua figura bianca come "
"la neve, mentre se ne sta qui, nel giardino illuminato dalla luna."

#: scenario3:scenario3_457BC5E0_624E_43E9_B1BB_AF87D2552128
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 00c3ed45cc600d99c686e9d7868938f4258ed78a27512621ee785703e0ff80ff
#. default-sha256: f96607e303ec76bb5b7be271b9aeb4056a4a7ab93e8a3964197677a7b646f949
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_457BC5E0_624E_43E9_B1BB_AF87D2552128"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I would hardly...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Um, ⟪k:4⟫what are you doing out so late?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, non direi...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Mmh, ⟪k:4⟫cosa ci fai qui fuori a quest’ora?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_654A59B7_5584_42CD_9134_31C48EE1A8E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 04c67cb2a0ae58b9ea0960fb3851495b80fbbc15399f0cb253b9f3893e6dda5a
#. default-sha256: 64d0c2a83267a6065b0ae66730f4212efc4a64d67b30cdcdf921f4c3858afe16
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_654A59B7_5584_42CD_9134_31C48EE1A8E2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I saw a figure through the window.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫On the slight chance it might be a burglar,"
"⟪k:4⟫I thought it my responsibility to ensure they did not break in."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Avevo visto qualcuno oltre la finestra.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Essendoci anche una minima possibilità "
"che potesse essere un ladro,⟪k:4⟫ho pensato che fosse mia responsabilità assicurarmi che non "
"entrasse."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4935B276_EA74_4831_A52A_A645C452BEFF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b87844f7efe54eeb924c7b73a374f8dfc5e992279e828ba8f8d856c4c76aee6
#. default-sha256: af8ca554433ebcb8c73dddcc51a09a99dcc1d43541f61d9e88a5a3694d6edf7e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4935B276_EA74_4831_A52A_A645C452BEFF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It was also the middle of the night when the grocer’s servant broke into their safe."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Era notte fonda anche quando il servo del droghiere aveva forzato la loro cassaforte."

#: scenario3:scenario3_34E7DCF2_024B_4C97_9867_2F839ECB2D7F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 28e2529e2213d45c3111e71a87eb3f2c9394c69133d19efb6466d535c8df4cae
#. default-sha256: 59fe0257386644a341fda9c69be1c923655fd960591ec732ebceb99f3cdcd8cc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_34E7DCF2_024B_4C97_9867_2F839ECB2D7F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫News of that spread quite far; I am sure you would have heard about it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La notizia si era diffusa ovunque;⟪k:1⟫sono certa che ne avrà sentito parlare."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FCBA1534_5D4C_424D_BE7E_ED0CADCEA75C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02f9af56356cea0ea9972e33ff7688ed1592c8969bad3f6f72ade05d9afcd14a
#. default-sha256: cfd5d9022b5f4996e852a73690cb52581b8337295b80e10f3227d9f930c66600
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FCBA1534_5D4C_424D_BE7E_ED0CADCEA75C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, but Gemasch was imprisoned some time ago.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Dear me, cannot seem to get my "
"head out of the past."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, ma Gemasch è stato imprigionato parecchio tempo fa.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Povera me, sembra che "
"io non riesca a non pensare al passato."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9F52C227_20CD_45C3_A885_8AEE78228065
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a499f65d4461b136c9d2b92e25207845311917d5967110fb61c976d5e00e7dd5
#. default-sha256: ff2c1926c48f67f54fb013a02688bc9654067ac00d32667f3f772daa638c7248
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9F52C227_20CD_45C3_A885_8AEE78228065"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫U-⟪k:2⟫Um...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫C-⟪k:2⟫Come...?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4A11ABC1_4B20_4CFC_994B_F02E1B694F3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 94c6ed7fbdbc6c22c963a009d34ecaf87963c23451db0526311a460905c93c56
#. default-sha256: 7e9e49731f67520b48832d688bf9d28326837f23aac264bc53727219c6fe64ac
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4A11ABC1_4B20_4CFC_994B_F02E1B694F3E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Do you intend to give that white rose to someone?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Intende dare quella rosa a qualcuno?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E5C62BCD_F9BF_44B3_8771_5B061984E998
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef49b552153dd2c5890b4e66349df0265843cd690970e99511201b7a56fea194
#. default-sha256: 7d9e1193149c5ba1fcde08f6419e6079d716230e7879105dd2a80296de9184be
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E5C62BCD_F9BF_44B3_8771_5B061984E998"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Y-⟪k:2⟫Yes. ⟪k:3⟫I was thinking about giving it to my husband."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...S-⟪k:2⟫Sì. ⟪k:3⟫Stavo pensando di darla a mio marito."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D451EF29_CB72_4698_80BB_220487F7C951
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dba2b92b6570f9d58bde191882e0ff8d19d2bd2f6798b84cf1bcd470f9712bfb
#. default-sha256: f2b51c05da761ad6b10d06a2b8bd7d90ef90cb9bcc1f122b58207469a29099e3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D451EF29_CB72_4698_80BB_220487F7C951"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫While I expect he has little fondness for such feminine tastes,⟪k:2⟫the scent of "
"flowers has a truly calming effect."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Benché lui non abbia gusti così eleganti,⟪k:2⟫il profumo dei fiori ha un effetto "
"davvero calmante."

#: scenario3:scenario3_80E6097D_BFF6_4A01_8208_FD02904C8D07
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 830a7ef71f623b9ffc99db276d6fa8f03d153951ae3263464faf177d786d8ce6
#. default-sha256: 5df43a2b796ec857e71378486e1a422d586623682ddb8ebb323bf59db7409fba
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_80E6097D_BFF6_4A01_8208_FD02904C8D07"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He might find it relaxing when he needs a reprieve from his work..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Potrebbe trovarlo rilassante qualora avesse bisogno di una tregua dal lavoro..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_01AF9E8B_AB0B_4FA1_8698_083235499A79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 82bb0e4d16815027af9243158c1a1f368bad9d47368338977d7d6a888292ba5d
#. default-sha256: aa78eddd96b731490e41faecff5dea551b35f5c709f8c64368d0f37a94ebcc8a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_01AF9E8B_AB0B_4FA1_8698_083235499A79"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, is that so?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You are very kindhearted."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah, è così?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Lei è davvero una donna di buon cuore."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9531573C_F950_4C64_B994_3D6AAD50D1D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 733317d0221f159c77a7e62ad0916bfbdca7dac4c98b72a06683155b4e894981
#. default-sha256: 77441adce7e233387686885f43232041e024429abda66756394eff0bc335b4dd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9531573C_F950_4C64_B994_3D6AAD50D1D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Speaking of white roses, the rose he meant to give you was the same shade of white."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A proposito di rose bianche... ⟪k:2⟫la rosa che lui avrebbe voluto darle, Madam, aveva "
"la stessa tonalità di bianco."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6003C6F8_58E3_45C3_AA57_561D9C9D7424
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2298136e82c6d3e9d2d6a3fc8bbc670749bc52229b1621d4dd0b996259af0c12
#. default-sha256: 168dcce1516b4044971eb63c7bf79c1fb3ad52a697b7ec2152335f281d9ee8eb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6003C6F8_58E3_45C3_AA57_561D9C9D7424"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh? “He”?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eh? ⟪k:2⟫“Lui”?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7C64D774_C5B1_447B_AAFF_C2DF2C458337
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1d53b8bd01e8b9dd1cc7f8db3146b017f4c02f38749874875581289ea24ec18
#. default-sha256: 20051410a255ae599c57cbfc3dc3d71a66cd0e91a01c22353c75719b74ee93dd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7C64D774_C5B1_447B_AAFF_C2DF2C458337"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But when you touched it, it turned a deep shade of red."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ma non appena la prese tra le mani,⟪k:2⟫assunse una profonda sfumatura di rosso."

#: scenario3:scenario3_586CF5EF_B1B9_43E5_87C7_70D5D1557952
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb1f6f2384c12b88378a82033cc9d642620e8036ca6ab40db00f736e6435bb52
#. default-sha256: 0f44ee15075ea40625c7c053cf6b01b51bf5c057bc28b2ac17102fb87ae71ac9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_586CF5EF_B1B9_43E5_87C7_70D5D1557952"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫There was but a single white rose in the garden,⟪k:25⟫"
"so he was unable to give it to you as he had wished.⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫In its place, he had a decorative "
"rose fashioned for you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫C’era una singola rosa bianca in giardino,⟪k:25⟫perciò "
"lui non poté più regalargliela come aveva desiderato.⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫Al suo posto, le regalò una rosa "
"ornamentale fatta apposta per lei."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7D4A9BCE_6B49_490E_A0EA_E8F4D28BE8C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c06d5571bd0067211ba1b6c3855d3dc25addcd37de4ea66d289782ea9b5a005d
#. default-sha256: b61a20f40125cd961e4b11eba534e7ced539e2bc517836759f268cec55a195ab
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7D4A9BCE_6B49_490E_A0EA_E8F4D28BE8C1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫U-⟪k:3⟫Um, what exactly are you referring to?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫M-⟪k:3⟫Mmh, a chi ti riferisci esattamente?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_19D477A7_AE3D_49E4_AFC6_CA8316B0C73F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8a7ed7d545fbf0eb88445f3d8e5399e6b3710c0228af6debdc93cab6a670ab8
#. default-sha256: 95ecc650ab585607f3b3b2093032b9a02dabe1d5dc122e19003e9e21e77e2321
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_19D477A7_AE3D_49E4_AFC6_CA8316B0C73F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh dear. Do you not remember?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh cielo. Non si ricorda?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5B478897_8F03_49D5_AF85_494B5627FA4B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d7bf43eb6e59de13ba17be946218bab9a12056ef819312535e4374f7b740fa4
