msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But that time, because you rejected the gift.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I am not criticizing you for "
"that decision, of course.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫You had a perfectly good reason for not accepting it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ma in quel caso, era perché lei, Madam, aveva rifiutato il suo regalo.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Sia "
"chiaro, non la sto criticando per la sua decisione.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Aveva buone ragioni per non "
"accettarlo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_687C96DB_B79F_4AE7_AA6A_82AD3B6E6A6A
