msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Heartbroken from having lost you, he buried the rose in this garden."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Con il cuore spezzato per averla persa,⟪k:2⟫il giovane seppellì la rosa in questo "
"giardino."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DCE135B0_8EFD_452F_8A3C_A58B4D6AF053
