msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Over the years, the roses in the garden withered away,⟪k:2⟫and in their place grew a "
"thick, unsightly nest of weeds."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nel corso degli anni, le rose del giardino appassirono,⟪k:2⟫e al loro posto crebbe un "
"folto e sgradevole nido di erbacce."

