msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Because I had been taking care of it, yes.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫But, for whatever reason, by my "
"hands alone I was unable to make it into anything quite as splendid as it is now."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Già, perché me ne sono presa cura io.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ma per qualche ragione, con le mie sole "
"forze non sono stata in grado di renderlo splendido com’è adesso."

#: scenario3:scenario3_361F4D58_7558_4191_A3DA_DB7F1597375E
